course: dictionary
lesson: 15954
title: Unsuspected
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: «The secret passage was unsuspected by the guards.» The guards did not know about the passage and had not guessed it was there. So unsuspected means not known about or not guessed. Check it by putting "not guessed" into the sentence, and it still makes sense.
explain: Unsuspected can also mean not thought to be guilty. «The thief walked past the police, unsuspected.» Nobody thought he had done anything wrong. The clues in the sentence, the police and the thief walking past, show which meaning fits.
explain: Look at the start of the word. The prefix un- means not, and suspect means to think something might be true or wrong. So unsuspected means "not suspected", and the words around it tell you which kind of not suspected is meant.
fact: Unsuspected is an adjective, so it describes a noun, as in an unsuspected talent.
fact: «Unsuspected» means not known about or not guessed.
fact: «Unsuspected» can also mean not thought to be guilty.
fact: In The Wind in the Willows, the secret tunnel into Toad Hall is unsuspected by the weasels.
fact: In science, an unsuspected result can lead to a discovery.
exercise: «The shy girl had an unsuspected talent for painting.» What does unsuspected mean here? | Very loud | *Not known about before | Given away for free | Badly painted
exercise: «The thief walked out of the shop, unsuspected by the guard.» What does unsuspected mean here? | *Not thought to be guilty | Carried in a bag | Shouting for help | Known to everyone
exercise: Mia says unsuspected means obvious. Why is she wrong? | Unsuspected means a kind of ice | Unsuspected means very large | *Unsuspected means not guessed, the opposite of obvious | Unsuspected means obvious and easy to see
test: «The secret tunnel was unsuspected by the weasels.» What does unsuspected mean? | Very long | *Not guessed or known about | Easy to see | Full of water
test: Which sentence uses unsuspected correctly? | The unsuspected dinner was served hot | The unsuspected cake was very dry | *The cave's hidden exit was unsuspected by the hunters | The sign was unsuspected, painted bright red on the door
exam: In «The secret passage was unsuspected by the guards», which clue shows the meaning is not guessed? | The word guards | The word passage | The word was | *The word secret, which means hidden
